  "mechanism_edge": {
    "__comment": "[ledger source] The causal model as rows - 22 edges over 23 quantities, lifted out of config/mechanism_models.json so ONE walk crosses it instead of a second traverser. `dir` is + / - / u. `to_quantity` may name a defect_kind (void, delam), which is already an entity in the ledger, so the chain closes onto the findings the walk already returns.",
