  },
  "mechanism_edge_to_quantity": {
    "__comment": "[ledger source] VIEW over mechanism_edge, to_role='quantity'. A binding builds ONE entity type, so an edge ending on a defect kind and one ending on a quantity cannot share a mapping. `to_role` comes from the model's own `finding_kind`, not from a spelled-out defect name.",
